                                   1860 
                                   1861     .area CODE
                                   1862 
                                   1863 ; syn8: X = payload'-relative DATA bit k -> A = x^((ND8+7-k) % 127) in
                                   1864 ; GF(2^8) mod x^8+x^2+x+1.  (8*(ND-1-p)+b+8 algebraically = ND8+7-k.)
                                   1865 ; Computed by repeated xtime instead of the 127-B XPOW flash table --
